  <para style="p"><char style="w" strong="G782" x-morph="V-AMM-2P" x-position="7" x-lemma="Ἀσπάσασθε" x-translit="Aspasasthe">Greet</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588" x-morph="Art-AMP" x-position="8" x-lemma="τοὺς" x-translit="tous">those who</char> <char style="w" strong="G1537" x-morph="Prep" x-position="9" x-lemma="ἐκ" x-translit="ek">belong to</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588" x-morph="Art-GMP" x-position="10" x-lemma="τῶν" x-translit="tōn">the household</char> <char style="w" strong="G711" x-morph="N-GMS" x-position="11" x-lemma="Ἀριστοβούλου" x-translit="Aristoboulou">of Aristobulus.</char></para>
