  <para style="p"><char style="w" strong="G782" x-morph="V-AMM-2P" x-position="9" x-lemma="Ἀσπάσασθε" x-translit="Aspasasthe">Greet</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588" x-morph="Art-AFS" x-position="11" x-lemma="τὴν" x-translit="tēn">my</char> <char style="w" strong="G27" x-morph="Adj-AFS" x-position="12" x-lemma="ἀγαπητήν" x-translit="agapētēn">beloved</char> <char style="w" strong="G4069" x-morph="N-AFS" x-position="10" x-lemma="Περσίδα" x-translit="Persida">Persis,</char> <char style="w" strong="G3748" x-morph="RelPro-NFS" x-position="13" x-lemma="ἥτις" x-translit="hētis">who</char> <char style="w" strong="G2872" x-morph="V-AIA-3S" x-position="15" x-lemma="ἐκοπίασεν" x-translit="ekopiasen">has worked</char> <char style="w" strong="G4183" x-morph="Adj-ANP" x-position="14" x-lemma="πολλὰ" x-translit="polla">very hard</char> <char style="w" strong="G1722" x-morph="Prep" x-position="16" x-lemma="ἐν" x-translit="en">in</char> <char style="w" strong="G2962" x-morph="N-DMS" x-position="17" x-lemma="Κυρίῳ" x-translit="Kyriō">the Lord.</char></para>
